<% pageTitle = 'Shipping Policy' %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <h1 class="section-title">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <p>Every artwork is hand-made to order, so production begins only after your order and reference photo are confirmed. Production time varies by artwork type, size, and current order volume — your estimated timeline is shared with you at the time of order.</p>
    <p>Once your artwork is complete and approved, it is carefully packed to prevent damage in transit and handed over to our courier partner. You'll receive your tracking details by WhatsApp/email as soon as it ships.</p>
    <p>We currently ship across India. Delivery times depend on your location and the courier partner's timelines, and are estimates rather than guarantees — occasional delays can happen due to weather, courier disruptions, or address issues.</p>
    <p>Please double-check your delivery address and phone number when ordering. We are not responsible for delays or non-delivery caused by an incorrect or incomplete address.</p>
    <p>You can track the status of your order anytime from the <a href="/track-order">Track Order</a> page using your Order ID and phone number.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
